A class, module, or function should have only one responsibility and only one reason to change
each class should do only one job
Ex:
Resturant
Chef- cook food
Cashier- handle paymnet
Cleaner- cleans
Each role has one responsibility.

Not good:
class OrderService {
    void placeOrder() { }
    void processPayment() { }
    void sendEmail() { }
}
Good:
class OrderService {
    void placeOrder(Order order) {
        // validate order
        // save order
    }
}
class PaymentService { }
class NotificationService { }
